    "text": "A modulated signal <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has the form <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></math> The carrier frequency <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;, the modulating frequency (message frequency) <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m ,&#160;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msub></math>and the modulation index <math><mi>&#956;</mi></math> are respectively given by :",
